{"u": "10773910145", "name": "[UPD] Mukbang Students", "place": "92386212135518", "created": "2026-10-31", "updated": "2026-11-24T03:21:16.564Z", "genre": "Survival", "subgenre": "1 vs All", "desc": "🎁 CODE: LIGHTSOUT (25 gems + 300 gold!)\n🆕 NEW: Lights Out mode, Library Hall map, crawling, map voting + new snacks!\n\n🍟 SNEAK SNACKS. DON'T GET CAUGHT. 🍟\n\nOne player is the TEACHER. Everyone else hides in a class full of NPC students... and the teacher has no idea which ones are real.\n\n📚 STUDENTS\nSnack, text and pass notes the second the teacher turns to write on the board. Every bit of mischief fills the class bar. Fill it before the bell and the whole class wins!\n\n✏️ TEACHER\nSpot the real players hiding in the crowd. Throw chalk, grab the troublemakers and tie them to a pillar. Catch them all before the bell!\n\n#worstclassever #classroom #school #teacher #students #hideandseek #prank #snacks #sneaky #dontgetcaught #party #funny #multiplayer #friends #escape #roleplay", "desc_hash": "e6461e8adb0f", "max_players": 7, "vip": false, "price": null, "avatar": "MorphToR15", "visits": 8653901, "favorites": 20524, "creator": {"id": 870481152, "name": "50uss", "type": "User", "verified": true}, "daily": {"2026-11-14": {"updated": "2026-11-14T13:53:36.17Z", "visits": 1079213, "fav": 3112, "up": 237, "down": 81}, "2026-11-15": {"updated": "2026-11-15T13:40:02.54Z", "visits": 2023249, "fav": 5343, "up": 457, "down": 169}, "2026-11-16": {"updated": "2026-11-16T08:22:30.38Z", "visits": 2828667, "fav": 7254, "up": 653, "down": 240}, "2026-11-17": {"updated": "2026-11-17T07:35:33.811Z", "visits": 3645015, "fav": 9162, "up": 839, "down": 305}, "2026-11-18": {"updated": "2026-11-17T07:35:33.811Z", "visits": 4333009, "fav": 10807, "up": 1039, "down": 359}, "2026-11-19": {"updated": "2026-11-17T07:35:33.811Z", "visits": 4884264, "fav": 12016, "up": 1183, "down": 413}, "2026-11-20": {"updated": "2026-11-17T07:35:33.811Z", "visits": 5504079, "fav": 13447, "up": 1335, "down": 473